      "content": "thanks. that makes sense. another thing though... if they're using sensors in the seat, i'm worried about things like heart rate variability or my breathing patterns being picked up through vibrations or micro-movements. are there any specific items i could place on the chair or even wear, like a certain kind of cushion or maybe a weighted vest, that might help stabilize those signals so they don't get a clear reading?",
